me.\u003c/p\u003e\n","description_plain":"I released the tool I use to organize my music playlists (I still buy CDs and rip them).\r\nVery basic, no frills, it just creates, edit and exports file lists to .m3u files.\r\n\r\nMy use case is maintaining playlists playable in a car audio, where paths must be relative to the playlist file.\r\nOn playlist export, MEU remaps the paths relative to the playlist file.\r\nAnd spot missing, invalid entries so to fix them, invalid entries are marked red on playlist import.\r\n\r\nFor Fedora/SUSE or other RPM based distros, I have a copr named \"teknoraver/meu\" with the packages.\r\n\r\nFeedback is welcome.","submitter_user":"teknoraver","user_is_author":true,"tags":["programming"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/yhwhf4","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/yhwhf4/meu_m3u_file_editor"},{"short_id":"lfxzi1","created_at":"2026-10-26T18:12:21.917-05:00","title":"Why I still teach OpenGL ES 3.0","url":"https://eliasfarhan.ch/graphics/cpp/2026/01/27/why-i-teach-opengles.html","score":2,"flags":0,"comment_count":0,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"Cloudef","user_is_author":false,"tags":["graphics"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/lfxzi1","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/lfxzi1/why_i_still_teach_opengl_es_3_0"},{"short_id":"rok489","created_at":"2026-10-26T17:56:49.493-05:00","title":"Hello, Graphite: Performance","url":"https://wcandillon.dev/article/hello-graphite-performance","score":1,"flags":0,"comment_count":0,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"jado","user_is_author":false,"tags":["mobile","performance"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/rok489","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/rok489/hello_graphite_performance"},{"short_id":"oztvnu","created_at":"2026-10-26T17:07:10.474-05:00","title":"Obfuscation from the Other Side - Laurie Kirk","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jfqFHHsYQAs\u0026vl=fr-FR","score":1,"flags":0,"comment_count":0,"description":"","description_plai